# ParcelTrack.http: requests you send with one click.
# In Visual Studio, open this file and click "Send request" above a request.
#
# @host is the address in your browser when you press F5 (the http profile).
@host = http://localhost:5420
@staff_token = paste-token-from-request-3-here
@admin_token = paste-token-from-request-9-here

### 1. Every parcel. Expect 200 OK, with fees (800, 650, 1250, 2000, 1250
GET {{host}}/api/parcels

### 2. Add a parcel with no token. Expect 401 Unauthorized
POST {{host}}/api/parcels
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client: Branch desk

{
  "trackingCode": "PT-200201",
  "recipient": "Damion Clarke",
  "weightKg": 4.2,
  "status": "Received",
  "branchId": 5
}

### 3. Login as Staff. Expect 200 OK + token (paste into @staff_token above)
# @name staffLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staff@parceltrack.test",
  "password": "Pass123!"
}

### 4. Login as Staff with wrong password. Expect 401 Unauthorized
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staff@parceltrack.test",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}

### 5. Add a parcel with Staff token and X-Client header. Expect 201 Created + Location header
POST {{host}}/api/parcels
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client: Branch desk

{
  "trackingCode": "PT-200201",
  "recipient": "Damion Clarke",
  "weightKg": 4.2,
  "status": "Received",
  "branchId": 5
}

### 6. Add a parcel with Staff token and bad tracking code AB-12. Expect 400 Bad Request ("Tracking code must look like PT-123456")
POST {{host}}/api/parcels
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client: Branch desk

{
  "trackingCode": "AB-12",
  "recipient": "Damion Clarke",
  "weightKg": 4.2,
  "status": "Received",
  "branchId": 5
}

### 7. Add a parcel with Staff token and no X-Client header. Expect 400 Bad Request ("Say which program is calling: add an X-Client header")
POST {{host}}/api/parcels
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingCode": "PT-200202",
  "recipient": "Nadine Walker",
  "weightKg": 1.0,
  "status": "Received",
  "branchId": 1
}

### 8. Delete parcel 5 with Staff token. Expect 403 Forbidden
DELETE {{host}}/api/parcels/5
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_token}}
X-Client: Branch desk

### 9. Login as Admin. Expect 200 OK + token (paste into @admin_token above)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@parceltrack.test",
  "password": "Pass123!"
}

### 10. Delete parcel 5 with Admin token. Expect 204 No Content
DELETE {{host}}/api/parcels/5
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
X-Client: Branch desk